{"sha": "a67277b81fe8c48d2cfaaebc72d4335ea4a41cc7195b3a7454c66e79f77e6665", "body": ["\\chapter{10\\,000 以内的数}\\label{ch:g3:numbers}", "", "一千、二千、三千\\,\\dots\\ 这些大数，", "都是利用一个巧妙的想法构造出来的：数字所在的\\emph{数位}", "决定了它表示的值。本章学习如何读数、写数、", "比较和排列 $10\\,000$ 以内的数。", "", "\\section{读数和写数}", "", "\\begin{definition}[数位值]\\label{def:g3:numbers:place}", "一个数用数字 $0, 1, 2, \\dots, 9$ 书写。从右往左，", "数位依次是：个位、十位、百位、千位。在", "$3\\,254$ 中：", "\\[", "3\\,254 = 3 \\text{ 个千} + 2 \\text{ 个百} + 5 \\text{ 个十}", "+ 4 \\text{ 个一}.", "\\]", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.9]", "  \\draw (0,0) grid[xstep=2.3, ystep=0.85] (9.2,1.7);", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (1.15,1.275) {千位};", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (3.45,1.275) {百位};", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (5.75,1.275) {十位};", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (8.05,1.275) {个位};", "  \\node[font=\\large, omDef] at (1.15,0.425) {$3$};", "  \\node[font=\\large, omDef] at (3.45,0.425) {$2$};", "  \\node[font=\\large, omDef] at (5.75,0.425) {$5$};", "  \\node[font=\\large, omDef] at (8.05,0.425) {$4$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small $3\\,254$ 的数位表，读作“三千二", "百五十四”。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[占位的零]\\label{ex:g3:numbers:zero}", "“四千零七”写作 $4\\,007$：千位上是 $4$，", "个位上是 $7$，中间的\\emph{零}用来占位，", "使每个数字都在正确的数位上。没有它们，$47$ 就是", "另一个完全不同的数！", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{example}[相邻数位的换算]\\label{ex:g3:numbers:exchange}", "10 个一是 1 个十；10 个十是 1 个百；10 个百是", "1 个千。所以 $10$ 个百 $= 1\\,000$，$32$ 个十", "$= 320$：数 $320$ 里含有 $32$ 个十（而不只是数字", "$2$！）。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{比较与排序}", "", "\\begin{method}[比较两个数]\\label{met:g3:numbers:compare}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 数一数位数：位数多的数更大", "        （$1\\,002 > 998$）。", "  \\item 位数相同时，逐位比较，", "        从\\emph{左}边数起，第一个不同的数字决定大小：", "        $5\\,614 > 5\\,589$，因为百位上 $6 > 5$。", "  \\item 用符号 $<$（小于）或 $>$", "        （大于）表示结果：开口总是朝着较大的数。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.1]", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (-0.3,0) -- (10.5,0);", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,1,...,10} \\draw (\\i,-0.08) -- (\\i,0.08);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0,-0.1) {$0$};", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (5,-0.1) {$500$};", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (10,-0.1) {$1000$};", "  \\fill[omThm] (2.4,0) circle (2pt) node[above, font=\\small] {$240$};", "  \\fill[omDef] (6.9,0) circle (2pt) node[above, font=\\small] {$690$};", "  \\fill[omMeth] (9.05,0) circle (2pt) node[above, font=\\small] {$905$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 数轴按百划分刻度，越靠右，", "数越大：$240 < 690 < 905$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g3:numbers:order}", "按从小到大的顺序排列：$780$、$8\\,700$、$807$、$87$。", "先看位数：$87$（两位），再是 $780$ 和 $807$", "（三位），最后是 $8\\,700$（四位）。比较 $780$ 和 $807$，", "看百位数字，$7 < 8$，所以 $780 < 807$。排好的顺序为：", "\\[", "87 < 780 < 807 < 8\\,700 .", "\\]", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{奇数和偶数}", "", "\\begin{definition}[偶数、奇数]\\label{def:g3:numbers:evenodd}", "一个数若能分成两个相等的整数部分，则称它为\\emph{偶数}\\index{偶数}", "——它的个位数字是 $0$、$2$、$4$、$6$ 或", "$8$。否则称为\\emph{奇数}\\index{奇数}（个位数字为 $1$、", "$3$、$5$、$7$ 或 $9$）。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{example}", "$46$ 是偶数（$46 = 23 + 23$）；$47$ 是奇数（不能分成两份相等的整数，", "否则需要半个物体）。只需看\\emph{最后一位}数字：$3\\,578$ 是", "偶数，$2\\,341$ 是奇数。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.45]", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,5} \\fill[omDef] ({\\i},0) circle (0.28);", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,5} \\fill[omDef] ({\\i},1) circle (0.28);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (2.5,-0.7) {$12$：偶数，两行数量相等};", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=10.5cm]", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,4} \\fill[omThm] ({\\i},0) circle (0.28);", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,4} \\fill[omThm] ({\\i},1) circle (0.28);", "  \\fill[omThm] (5,0) circle (0.28);", "  \\draw[omExo, thick] (5,0) circle (0.5);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (2.5,-0.7) {$11$：奇数，多出一个单独的点};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}